<title>USA: Waters files for 2.0 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>Waters files for 2.0 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Mass. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waters Corp said Thursday it had filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a secondary public offering of 2,031,904 common shares.</p>
<p>All of the stock iw being sold by current shareholders, the company said. Waters will not receive any proceeds from the offering, it stressed.</p>
<p>The offering is being managed by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
